#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: index.docbook:483
#, no-c-format
msgid "This option preserves the playground aspect ratio when resizing the &ktuberling; window. When the playground aspect ratio does not match the one of the window the background is filled with the one specified in the theme."
